 "description": {
  "id": "Judul tulisan tangan yang tertulis huruf demi huruf: topeng menyapu tiap glif kiri ke kanan dengan laju pena dan jeda angkat pena antar kata, lalu garis bawah coretan seukuran teks tergambar. Mode sorot: stabilo menyapu kata demi kata. Teks dan coretan bergoyang (boil).",
  "en": "Handwritten title with a letter-by-letter write-on (a mask sweeps each glyph with pen pacing and pen lifts between words) and a squiggle underline sized to the text. Highlight mode sweeps a marker word by word. Boils."
 },
